1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Anak dah makan, suami dah makan…
IBU? “Nanti la…”

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,400
7.15 pagi. Kak Ana siapkan anak dulu.

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:07,930
Untuk diri sendiri? Secawan kopi je.

4
00:00:07,930 --> 00:00:10,600
11 pagi, dalam mesyuarat… perut berbunyi.

5
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:13,200
Kepala rasa berat. Capai biskut dalam laci.

6
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,860
Petang balik, lapar sangat. Makan banyak sekali gus.

7
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:18,200
Bukan sebab tak tahu jaga makan.

8
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,300
Tapi ibu selalu letak diri paling akhir.

9
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,300
Pinggan Sihat KKM:
½ sayur & buah

10
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:24,100
¼ bijirin penuh, ¼ protein

11
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,860
Hadkan gula tambahan, termasuk minuman.

12
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:28,200
Idea 1: telur rebus, roti gandum, pisang

13
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:30,400
Idea 2: oat rendam semalaman + buah

14
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:32,200
Siapkan bekal ibu sekali dengan bekal anak

15
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:33,790
Air kosong dulu, baru kopi.

16
00:00:33,790 --> 00:00:36,400
Protein + karbo kompleks + serat, kenyang lebih lama.

17
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:37,900
Hari terlalu kelam-kabut?

18
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:39,800
Nutrilite Soy Protein Drink boleh jadi pilihan tambahan.

19
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:41,720
Tapi BUKAN pengganti sarapan sebenar.

20
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:44,200
Ibu pun manusia. Duduk 5 minit, makan dengan tenang.

21
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:46,600
Ibu pun perlu diisi.

